[{"key": "4a1e712b-60c7-4a1a-ba46-bb7dd890b366|point|3", "text": "got to → gotta"}, {"key": "4a1e712b-60c7-4a1a-ba46-bb7dd890b366|caution", "text": "这些是非正式口语形式。不要把它们写进论文、邮件或正式考试中，在正式演讲中也应避免使用。"}, {"key": "b8706c44-5a49-402e-9382-f18427f2084c|explain", "text": "更多你在电影和真实对话中会不断听到的随意缩略形式。"}, {"key": "b8706c44-5a49-402e-9382-f18427f2084c|point|0", "text": "kind of → kinda"}, {"key": "b8706c44-5a49-402e-9382-f18427f2084c|point|1", "text": "sort of → sorta"}, {"key": "b8706c44-5a49-402e-9382-f18427f2084c|point|2", "text": "let me → lemme"}, {"key": "b8706c44-5a49-402e-9382-f18427f2084c|point|3", "text": "give me → gimme"}, {"key": "b8706c44-5a49-402e-9382-f18427f2084c|point|4", "text": "what do you → whaddaya"}, {"key": "b8706c44-5a49-402e-9382-f18427f2084c|caution", "text": "仅限非正式场合。在 IELTS 或求职面试中，请保留完整形式。"}, {"key": "1fe69396-9206-4baf-a8e5-ffcf1b604754|explain", "text": "更多在轻松口语英语中常见的义务和习惯类缩略形式。"}, {"key": "1fe69396-9206-4baf-a8e5-ffcf1b604754|point|0", "text": "have to → hafta"}, {"key": "1fe69396-9206-4baf-a8e5-ffcf1b604754|point|1", "text": "need to → needa"}, {"key": "1fe69396-9206-4baf-a8e5-ffcf1b604754|point|2", "text": "used to → useta"}, {"key": "1fe69396-9206-4baf-a8e5-ffcf1b604754|caution", "text": "仅为非正式口语形式——绝不要写出来。"}, {"key": "9b9c6914-86f0-4448-91ad-32332b1c44bd|explain", "text": "过去情态动词的缩略形式——在谈论遗憾或假设情境时非常常见。"}, {"key": "9b9c6914-86f0-4448-91ad-32332b1c44bd|point|0", "text": "could have → coulda"}, {"key": "9b9c6914-86f0-4448-91ad-32332b1c44bd|point|1", "text": "would have → woulda"}, {"key": "9b9c6914-86f0-4448-91ad-32332b1c44bd|point|2", "text": "should have → shoulda"}, {"key": "9b9c6914-86f0-4448-91ad-32332b1c44bd|caution", "text": "仅限非正式口语——在正式写作中要完整写出 'could have'。"}, {"key": "93381b1d-c960-4403-9a28-d6c4d2a93b75|explain", "text": "非常随意的缩略形式，常见于歌曲、电影和朋友间的轻松对话中。"}, {"key": "93381b1d-c960-4403-9a28-d6c4d2a93b75|point|0", "text": "don't know → dunno"}, {"key": "93381b1d-c960-4403-9a28-d6c4d2a93b75|point|1", "text": "don't you → dontcha"}, {"key": "93381b1d-c960-4403-9a28-d6c4d2a93b75|point|2", "text": "what are you → whatcha"}, {"key": "93381b1d-c960-4403-9a28-d6c4d2a93b75|caution", "text": "非常不正式——只和亲密朋友使用，绝不要在职业或考试场合使用。"}, {"key": "7b1c6a89-bdad-45bd-9a41-802609c8f2ff|explain", "text": "随意口语中常见的与介词相关的缩略形式。"}, {"key": "7b1c6a89-bdad-45bd-9a41-802609c8f2ff|point|0", "text": "out of → outta"}, {"key": "7b1c6a89-bdad-45bd-9a41-802609c8f2ff|point|1", "text": "off of → offa"}, {"key": "7b1c6a89-bdad-45bd-9a41-802609c8f2ff|point|2", "text": "cup of → cuppa"}, {"key": "7b1c6a89-bdad-45bd-9a41-802609c8f2ff|caution", "text": "仅限非正式场合。"}, {"key": "beaa82ee-d675-44b8-adf8-596c8ca37c5a|explain", "text": "日常感叹语和带有大量缩略的随意短语。"}, {"key": "beaa82ee-d675-44b8-adf8-596c8ca37c5a|point|0", "text": "come on → c'mon"}, {"key": "beaa82ee-d675-44b8-adf8-596c8ca37c5a|point|1", "text": "going to be → gonna be"}, {"key": "beaa82ee-d675-44b8-adf8-596c8ca37c5a|point|2", "text": "some more → s'more"}, {"key": "beaa82ee-d675-44b8-adf8-596c8ca37c5a|caution", "text": "仅限非正式场合。"}, {"key": "96d3b17b-36da-4b59-a18b-5199dc78c582|explain", "text": "在快速、随意的对话中，疑问句开头词会大幅缩略。"}, {"key": "96d3b17b-36da-4b59-a18b-5199dc78c582|point|0", "text": "did you → dja"}, {"key": "96d3b17b-36da-4b59-a18b-5199dc78c582|point|1", "text": "do you → dya"}, {"key": "96d3b17b-36da-4b59-a18b-5199dc78c582|point|2", "text": "would you → wouldja"}, {"key": "96d3b17b-36da-4b59-a18b-5199dc78c582|caution", "text": "仅用于随意口语语境。"}, {"key": "aef0d49a-5252-4ae2-bca1-9a54870c0117|explain", "text": "随意口语中也常缩略时间短语。"}, {"key": "aef0d49a-5252-4ae2-bca1-9a54870c0117|point|0", "text": "a couple of → a couple"}, {"key": "aef0d49a-5252-4ae2-bca1-9a54870c0117|point|1", "text": "in a minute → in a min"}, {"key": "aef0d49a-5252-4ae2-bca1-9a54870c0117|caution", "text": "随意交谈中可以，书面语中不行。"}, {"key": "294bc66f-885f-487c-a434-e3f668c306c5|explain", "text": "更多在轻松对话中不断听到的常见随意缩略。"}, {"key": "294bc66f-885f-487c-a434-e3f668c306c5|point|0", "text": "probably → prolly"}, {"key": "294bc66f-885f-487c-a434-e3f668c306c5|point|1", "text": "trying to → tryna"}, {"key": "294bc66f-885f-487c-a434-e3f668c306c5|point|2", "text": "supposed to → s'posed to"}, {"key": "294bc66f-885f-487c-a434-e3f668c306c5|caution", "text": "仅限非正式口语。"}, {"key": "5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|explain", "text": "朋友之间和美式非正式口语中常见的随意缩略。"}, {"key": "5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|point|0", "text": "let's go → less go"}, {"key": "5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|point|1", "text": "give it to me → gimme that"}, {"key": "5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|point|2", "text": "you all → y'all"}, {"key": "5b03a85a-0d23-44a4-b9b5-647d6e65d86f|caution", "text": "非常非正式——'y'all' 有地域性（美国南方），但被广泛理解。 (US)"}, {"key": "1015f614-a8a6-4634-97e1-86252ed3b149|explain", "text": "在快速、随意的美式口语中，整数词的中间辅音会弱化。"}, {"key": "1015f614-a8a6-4634-97e1-86252ed3b149|point|0", "text": "twenty → twenny"}, {"key": "1015f614-a8a6-4634-97e1-86252ed3b149|point|1", "text": "hundred → hunnerd"}, {"key": "1015f614-a8a6-4634-97e1-86252ed3b149|caution", "text": "仅限非正式口语——正式场合始终使用完整形式。"}, {"key": "69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|explain", "text": "另一组在日常快速、轻松口语中经常丢失一个音节的常用词。"}, {"key": "69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|point|0", "text": "different → diff'rent"}, {"key": "69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|point|1", "text": "general → gen'ral"}, {"key": "69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|point|2", "text": "several → sev'ral"}, {"key": "69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|point|3", "text": "camera → cam'ra"}, {"key": "69aea060-6196-4732-a658-25a6b0d08e52|caution", "text": "在随意口语中没问题；在正式演讲中要清晰地说出完整形式。"}, {"key": "d19575cd-6d8a-4493-b1e0-f3d272543988|explain", "text": "这些是非常不正式的缩略形式，你会在歌曲和随意的美式口语中听到，但绝不应在职业场合使用。"}, {"key": "d19575cd-6d8a-4493-b1e0-f3d272543988|point|0", "text": "I'm going to → I'ma"}, {"key": "d19575cd-6d8a-4493-b1e0-f3d272543988|point|1", "text": "kind of like → kinda like"}, {"key": "d19575cd-6d8a-4493-b1e0-f3d272543988|caution", "text": "极其不正式——仅限朋友之间/歌词中使用，绝不可用于职业场合。"}, {"key": "551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|explain", "text": "除了 what's up / how's it going 之外，更多日常问候的缩略形式。"}, {"key": "551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|point|0", "text": "how are you → how ya doin'"}, {"key": "551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|point|1", "text": "good to see you → good to see ya"}, {"key": "551b9527-f712-421d-966c-24644f360746|caution", "text": "仅限随意口语形式。"}, {"key": "b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|explain", "text": "更多在轻松美式口语中常见的义务和意愿类缩略形式。"}, {"key": "b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|point|0", "text": "ought to → oughta"}, {"key": "b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|point|1", "text": "don't have to → don't hafta"}, {"key": "b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|point|2", "text": "want you → wantcha"}, {"key": "b855faed-9428-4a1b-b95c-1e0c3b2d30c8|caution", "text": "仅限非正式口语。"}, {"key": "a988c705-5d07-4e9a-a930-5967242b673b|explain", "text": "这是随意美式缩略能走多远的经典例子——几个词模糊成一个听起来像单词的音。"}, {"key": "a988c705-5d07-4e9a-a930-5967242b673b|point|0", "text": "Did you eat yet? → Jeetyet?"}, {"key": "a988c705-5d07-4e9a-a930-5967242b673b|point|1", "text": "Did you already? → Jeetalready?"}, {"key": "a988c705-5d07-4e9a-a930-5967242b673b|caution", "text": "极其不正式——用于识别快速母语语音，而非你自己的正式口语。"}, {"key": "e363cee4-e7a6-4107-9da8-a4a5ac3c4a47|explain", "text": "随意对话中另外两个常见的短语级缩略形式。"}, {"key": "e363cee4-e7a6-4107-9da8-a4a5ac3c4a47|point|0", "text": "because of → 'cause of"}, {"key": "e363cee4-e7a6-4107-9da8-a4a5ac3c4a47|point|1", "text": "sort of a → sorta a"}, {"key": "e363cee4-e7a6-4107-9da8-a4a5ac3c4a47|caution", "text": "仅限非正式口语。"}, {"key": "d885413e-df2d-4088-b5a9-f07b62449289|explain", "text": "在轻松英语口语中，非常常见的 'yes' 和 'no' 的随意替代说法。"}, {"key": "d885413e-df2d-4088-b5a9-f07b62449289|point|0", "text": "yes → yep / uh-huh"}, {"key": "d885413e-df2d-4088-b5a9-f07b62449289|point|1", "text": "no → nope / nah"}, {"key": "d885413e-df2d-4088-b5a9-f07b62449289|caution", "text": "仅限随意对话——在正式或考试场合请使用 'yes'/'no'。"}, {"key": "d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|explain", "text": "两者都缩略为发音相似的 'wanna'，但一个后面接名词，另一个后面接动词——值得注意这一区别。"}, {"key": "d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|point|0", "text": "want a (coffee) → wanna coffee"}, {"key": "d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|point|1", "text": "want to (go) → wanna go"}, {"key": "d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语。"}, {"key": "d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|note|0", "text": "'want a' + 名词 → wanna"}, {"key": "d0dc977b-e24c-46c3-a2a1-6a98544f014f|note|1", "text": "'want to' + 动词 → wanna"}, {"key": "6c1b9c14-fcf8-463c-9ba2-34b43d55e77f|explain", "text": "'would have' 的否定形式与肯定形式遵循相同的缩读方式。"}, {"key": "6c1b9c14-fcf8-463c-9ba2-34b43d55e77f|point|0", "text": "wouldn't have → wouldn'ta"}, {"key": "6c1b9c14-fcf8-463c-9ba2-34b43d55e77f|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语——其他场合请完整写出 'wouldn't have'。"}, {"key": "2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|explain", "text": "另外两个日常缩读，常见于随意的解释和请求中。"}, {"key": "2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|point|0", "text": "just because → just 'cause"}, {"key": "2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|point|1", "text": "going to need → gonna need"}, {"key": "2856e155-9edf-4a4e-9b05-c66ea6dac7d1|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语。"}, {"key": "233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|explain", "text": "'Ain't' 在非常随意的口语中替代 am not/is not/are not/has not/have not，在歌曲和非正式交谈中随处可见。"}, {"key": "233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|point|0", "text": "I am not → I ain't"}, {"key": "233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|point|1", "text": "that is not → that ain't"}, {"key": "233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|point|2", "text": "you have not → you ain't"}, {"key": "233cf355-0eca-4443-9a49-65fb7f9946ac|caution", "text": "切勿在书面语或正式讲话中使用——被视为非标准语法，尽管在非正式场合极为常见。"}, {"key": "dc20f314-54fe-4dbd-a7f9-1b8af815d3af|explain", "text": "一种非常常见的随意说法，表示 'I understand'，或字面意思 'caught you'。"}, {"key": "dc20f314-54fe-4dbd-a7f9-1b8af815d3af|point|0", "text": "got you（理解）→ gotcha"}, {"key": "dc20f314-54fe-4dbd-a7f9-1b8af815d3af|point|1", "text": "got you（抓住）→ gotcha"}, {"key": "dc20f314-54fe-4dbd-a7f9-1b8af815d3af|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语——在职业场合请说 'I understand' 或 'got it'。"}, {"key": "83e44703-96d2-48c4-8303-0bc0b0bbb6ed|explain", "text": "用于对过去进行猜测的情态动词完成式缩读，与 coulda/woulda/shoulda 并列。"}, {"key": "83e44703-96d2-48c4-8303-0bc0b0bbb6ed|point|0", "text": "must have → musta"}, {"key": "83e44703-96d2-48c4-8303-0bc0b0bbb6ed|point|1", "text": "might have → mighta"}, {"key": "83e44703-96d2-48c4-8303-0bc0b0bbb6ed|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语——其他场合请完整写出 'must have'/'might have'。"}, {"key": "ae8c9220-fd86-4c54-a3d7-97ceb131af9a|explain", "text": "coulda/woulda/shoulda 的否定对应形式，谈论遗憾时很常见。"}, {"key": "ae8c9220-fd86-4c54-a3d7-97ceb131af9a|point|0", "text": "shouldn't have → shouldn'ta"}, {"key": "ae8c9220-fd86-4c54-a3d7-97ceb131af9a|point|1", "text": "couldn't have → couldn'ta"}, {"key": "ae8c9220-fd86-4c54-a3d7-97ceb131af9a|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语——正式场合请完整写出 'shouldn't have'/'couldn't have'。"}, {"key": "7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|explain", "text": "在轻松的口语中，词尾的 -ing 音常省略 'g'，听起来像 -in'。几乎所有 -ing 动词都会出现这种情况。 (, so it sounds like -in)"}, {"key": "7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|point|0", "text": "doing → doin'"}, {"key": "7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|point|1", "text": "going → goin'"}, {"key": "7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|point|2", "text": "talking → talkin'"}, {"key": "7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|point|3", "text": "thinking → thinkin'"}, {"key": "7c1b096d-60ed-4c34-b500-ab3afab592fa|caution", "text": "仅限随意口语——在演讲、面试和考试中要清晰地发出完整的 '-ing'。"}, {"key": "0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|explain", "text": "同样的 g 音脱落规律也适用于以 -thing 结尾的不定代词。"}, {"key": "0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|point|0", "text": "something → somethin'"}, {"key": "0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|point|1", "text": "nothing → nothin'"}, {"key": "0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|point|2", "text": "anything → anythin'"}, {"key": "0269fc6d-11c6-4667-9e5f-34ff1033bcf6|caution", "text": "仅限随意口语。"}, {"key": "cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|explain", "text": "在非常常见的随意口语中，'Them' 在动词后缩减为 'em（'th' 音脱落）。"}, {"key": "cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|point|0", "text": "tell them → tell 'em"}, {"key": "cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|point|1", "text": "get them → get 'em"}, {"key": "cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|point|2", "text": "ask them → ask 'em"}, {"key": "cd64bb2e-37b3-4869-94d3-830cbdf2eb6a|caution", "text": "仅限非正式口语——在书面语或正式讲话中要完整地说 'them'。"}, {"key": "66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|explain", "text": "在两个紧密相连的词之间，'And' 缩减为一个快速的 'n' 音，尤其是在固定短语中。"}, {"key": "66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|point|0", "text": "rock and roll → rock 'n' roll"}, {"key": "66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|point|1", "text": "fish and chips → fish 'n' chips"}, {"key": "66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|point|2", "text": "back and forth → back 'n' forth"}, {"key": "66b204c8-d0cb-4469-a82c-7416aa6f96b6|caution", "text": "常见于固定短语和快速语流中——在正式写作中要清晰地写出 'and'。"}, {"key": "74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4ed9c9028|explain", "text": "在随意回答中，单独使用的 'Because'（不仅仅是 'because of'）常缩短为 'cause。"}, {"key": "74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4ed9c9028|point|0", "text": "because → 'cause"}, {"key": "74f83968-80ee-48d6-8255-ecd4ed9c9028|caution", "text": "仅限非正式口语——其他情况下要完整写出 'because'。"}, {"key": "f8740e37-88d7-4e64-a74d-762766ff4593|explain", "text": "在快速、随意的回答中，'Of course' 常省略第一个词。"}, {"key": "f8740e37-88d7-4e64-a74d-762766ff4593|point|0", "text": "of course → 'course"}, {"key": "f8740e37-88d7-4e64-a74d-762766ff4593|caution", "text": "仅限随意口语。"}, {"key": "a1c62d96-731e-4d96-803e-33f2cd732fc7|explain", "text": "'all right' 的一种非常常见的随意发音，用于表示同意或回应。"}, {"key": "a1c62d96-731e-4d96-803e-33f2cd732fc7|point|0", "text": "all right → aight"}, {"key": "a1c62d96-731e-4d96-803e-33f2cd732fc7|caution", "text": "非常不正式——在职业场合中要说 'all right' 或 'okay'。"}, {"key": "fd275dbf-ca1f-489e-93aa-a7928df2aa76|explain", "text": "'Let you' 的缩减方式与 'want you'/'wantcha' 相同。"}, {"key": "fd275dbf-ca1f-489e-93aa-a7928df2aa76|point|0", "text": "let you → letcha"}, {"key": "fd275dbf-ca1f-489e-93aa-a7928df2aa76|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语。"}, {"key": "9bf1b2d8-c97b-4451-8371-0efb3b24ecd0|explain", "text": "另一种极端快速语流融合，类似于 'jeetyet'——多个词压缩成一个音。"}, {"key": "9bf1b2d8-c97b-4451-8371-0efb3b24ecd0|point|0", "text": "did you ever → jever"}, {"key": "9bf1b2d8-c97b-4451-8371-0efb3b24ecd0|caution", "text": "用于识别母语者的快速语流，不适用于你自己的正式口语。"}, {"key": "82a1afdf-f024-41d9-bb83-15d15e39a5cf|explain", "text": "当 'going to' 和 'have to' 同时出现时，两种缩读会叠加在一起。"}, {"key": "82a1afdf-f024-41d9-bb83-15d15e39a5cf|point|0", "text": "going to have to → gonna hafta"}, {"key": "82a1afdf-f024-41d9-bb83-15d15e39a5cf|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语——其他场合请完整写出 'going to have to'。"}, {"key": "d7d2b06f-c8dd-444a-ba6e-638346e18810|explain", "text": "'gonna' 缩读在否定式和过去式中同样适用。"}, {"key": "d7d2b06f-c8dd-444a-ba6e-638346e18810|point|0", "text": "not going to → not gonna"}, {"key": "d7d2b06f-c8dd-444a-ba6e-638346e18810|point|1", "text": "wasn't going to → wasn't gonna"}, {"key": "d7d2b06f-c8dd-444a-ba6e-638346e18810|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语。"}, {"key": "b0c3028d-02d0-4b69-b6b0-310ed3468566|explain", "text": "英式英语中非常常见的反意疑问句缩读，用于确认或加强语气。"}, {"key": "b0c3028d-02d0-4b69-b6b0-310ed3468566|point|0", "text": "isn't it → innit"}, {"key": "b0c3028d-02d0-4b69-b6b0-310ed3468566|caution", "text": "非常非正式的英式俚语——即使在英国，也不要在正式场合使用。 (UK)"}, {"key": "ddb8cc83-dc22-4690-8bab-748461e813e9|explain", "text": "一种随意提出建议或征求同意的说法。"}, {"key": "ddb8cc83-dc22-4690-8bab-748461e813e9|point|0", "text": "what do you say → whaddya say"}, {"key": "ddb8cc83-dc22-4690-8bab-748461e813e9|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语。"}, {"key": "16f619b1-adfc-405e-a120-14925cf94795|explain", "text": "英语口语中极其常见的填充语，用于思考时或加强语气。"}, {"key": "16f619b1-adfc-405e-a120-14925cf94795|point|0", "text": "you know → y'know"}, {"key": "16f619b1-adfc-405e-a120-14925cf94795|caution", "text": "仅作随意填充语——过度使用即使是非正式场合也会显得不够得体。"}, {"key": "3b8f4cc8-03e2-4857-8f5b-1fdccc205c54|explain", "text": "非常随意的问候语，由 'what's up' 缩短而来。"}, {"key": "3b8f4cc8-03e2-4857-8f5b-1fdccc205c54|point|0", "text": "what's up → s'up"}, {"key": "3b8f4cc8-03e2-4857-8f5b-1fdccc205c54|caution", "text": "非常非正式的问候语，仅用于朋友之间。"}, {"key": "6f674595-f4b4-44fa-9edf-d597d0a2e73a|explain", "text": "'Him' 和 'her' 在随意口语中也会弱化，类似于 'them' → 'em。"}, {"key": "6f674595-f4b4-44fa-9edf-d597d0a2e73a|point|0", "text": "tell him → tell 'im"}, {"key": "6f674595-f4b4-44fa-9edf-d597d0a2e73a|point|1", "text": "ask her → ask 'er"}, {"key": "6f674595-f4b4-44fa-9edf-d597d0a2e73a|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语。"}, {"key": "066faaed-c7b6-44d1-8bd5-0c29a8119dcb|explain", "text": "'Kinda' 和 'sorta' 在非常随意的口语中常组合使用，以增强模糊表达。"}, {"key": "066faaed-c7b6-44d1-8bd5-0c29a8119dcb|point|0", "text": "kind of sort of → kinda sorta"}, {"key": "066faaed-c7b6-44d1-8bd5-0c29a8119dcb|caution", "text": "非常非正式——避免在任何专业或考试场合使用。"}, {"key": "5bee9ab9-fa4b-4174-b055-5e0daa1d4a08|explain", "text": "另一个快速语流中的问句开头缩合形式，与 dja 和 wouldja 并列。"}, {"key": "5bee9ab9-fa4b-4174-b055-5e0daa1d4a08|point|0", "text": "didn't you → dincha"}, {"key": "5bee9ab9-fa4b-4174-b055-5e0daa1d4a08|caution", "text": "用于识别母语者的快速语流，不适用于你自己的正式口语。"}, {"key": "b787eef9-022a-4553-a472-0e4e7077c0e4|explain", "text": "'have to' 的过去式形式与现在式形式的弱读方式相同。"}, {"key": "b787eef9-022a-4553-a472-0e4e7077c0e4|point|0", "text": "had to → hadta"}, {"key": "b787eef9-022a-4553-a472-0e4e7077c0e4|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语。"}, {"key": "0ea50af7-f1be-4ee5-90c9-acf52cfb6dbf|explain", "text": "用于非正式请求中的随意缩合形式，与 wouldja 和 couldja 类形式并列。"}, {"key": "0ea50af7-f1be-4ee5-90c9-acf52cfb6dbf|point|0", "text": "will you → willcha"}, {"key": "0ea50af7-f1be-4ee5-90c9-acf52cfb6dbf|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语。"}, {"key": "8eb2f2ac-a4c2-41e6-bc12-9cf7f4a95bc1|explain", "text": "含 'of' 的数量短语，其弱读方式与 'cuppa' 中 'cup of' 的弱读方式相同。"}, {"key": "8eb2f2ac-a4c2-41e6-bc12-9cf7f4a95bc1|point|0", "text": "lots of → lotsa"}, {"key": "8eb2f2ac-a4c2-41e6-bc12-9cf7f4a95bc1|point|1", "text": "bunch of → buncha"}, {"key": "8eb2f2ac-a4c2-41e6-bc12-9cf7f4a95bc1|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语。"}, {"key": "643d42f4-55c6-49bb-ba59-6641d41b118a|explain", "text": "一个语气强烈的非正式强调表达，意为 '非常令人印象深刻/巨大的'。 (a very impressive/big)"}, {"key": "643d42f4-55c6-49bb-ba59-6641d41b118a|point|0", "text": "hell of a → helluva"}, {"key": "643d42f4-55c6-49bb-ba59-6641d41b118a|caution", "text": "略显粗俗——与朋友间使用无妨，但应避免在职业或礼貌场合使用。"}, {"key": "d91f71d3-f31d-4215-8d05-8e8a07483832|explain", "text": "旧时问候语 'how do you do' 的历史缩合形式，现已成为独立的随意、友好的问候语（尤其在美国南部）。 (US)"}, {"key": "d91f71d3-f31d-4215-8d05-8e8a07483832|point|0", "text": "how do you do → howdy"}, {"key": "d91f71d3-f31d-4215-8d05-8e8a07483832|caution", "text": "仅用于随意、友好的问候。"}, {"key": "47538641-f573-4840-af35-02857a1d24de|explain", "text": "'I suppose' 在随意口语中通常省略中间音节，用于表达轻微的不确定或勉强的同意——与 'supposed to' → s'posed to 不同。"}, {"key": "47538641-f573-4840-af35-02857a1d24de|point|0", "text": "I suppose → I s'pose"}, {"key": "47538641-f573-4840-af35-02857a1d24de|caution", "text": "仅用于非正式口语——其他场合请完整书写 'I suppose'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|explain", "text": "通过 50 个针对性练习掌握缩合发音。仔细聆听 AI 示范，跟读并录制你的声音，即可获得详细的实时发音评分和反馈。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|point|0", "text": "专注于每个练习中标注的节奏、重音和语流。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|point|1", "text": "每次录音前先聆听参考示范音频。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|point|2", "text": "查看你的 AI 评分和音素级反馈，找出需要改进的地方。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|caution", "text": "不要匆忙完成练习；优先保证清晰度、自然语调和准确发音。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|0", "text": "将辅助词极度缩合，融入自然语流。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|1", "text": "'going to' -> 'gonna'；'him' -> ''im'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|2", "text": "'have got to' 缩合为 'gotta'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|3", "text": "'want a' → 'wanna'；'of' → 'a' /ə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|4", "text": "'has to' → 'hasta' /hæstə/；'for' → /fər/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|5", "text": "'let me' → 'lemme'；'you' → 'ya'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|6", "text": "'give me' → 'gimme'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|7", "text": "'could you' → 'couldja' /kʊdʒə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|8", "text": "'would you' → 'wouldja'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|9", "text": "'what did you' → 'whaddya'；'him' → ''im'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|10", "text": "'should have' → 'shoulda' /ʃʊdə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|11", "text": "'could have' → 'coulda' /kʊdə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|12", "text": "'would have' → 'woulda' /wʊdə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|13", "text": "'must have' → 'musta' /mʌstə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|14", "text": "'might have' → 'mighta' /maɪtə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|15", "text": "'used to' → 'usta' /juːstə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|16", "text": "'supposed to' → 'sposta' /spoʊstə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|17", "text": "'need to' → 'needa'；'to' → /də/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|18", "text": "'to' → /də/；'for' → /fər/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|19", "text": "'kind of' → 'kinda' /kaɪndə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|20", "text": "'sort of' → 'sorta' /sɔːrtə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|21", "text": "'lots of' → 'lotsa' /lɒtsə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|22", "text": "'out of' → 'outta' /aʊtə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|23", "text": "'front of' → 'fronta'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|24", "text": "在非正式口语中，'I am going to' 缩减为 'I'mma'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|25", "text": "'don't you' → 'doncha'；'want to' → 'wanna'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|26", "text": "'didn't you' → 'didn'tcha'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|27", "text": "'haven't you' → 'haven'tcha'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|28", "text": "'and' 缩减为成音节 'n' /n/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|29", "text": "'day and night' → 'day 'n night'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|30", "text": "'or' 缩减为 /ər/；'it or' 无缝闪音化。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|31", "text": "'or' 缩减为非重读的 /ər/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|32", "text": "'and' 在塞音之间缩减为 /n/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|33", "text": "关系代词 'that' 弱读为 /ðət/，使用 schwa。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|34", "text": "连词 'that' 弱读且短促。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|35", "text": "'that' 读作 /ðət/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|36", "text": "'them' 弱读为 ''em' /əm/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|37", "text": "'them' -> ''em'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|38", "text": "'them' -> ''em'。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|39", "text": "'some' -> /səm/；'for' -> /fər/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|40", "text": "'for' -> /fər/；'you' -> /jə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|41", "text": "'are' -> /ər/；'you' -> /jə/；'to' -> /tə/。"}, {"key": "32c7dc70-a486-4d9c-8fb8-e9696206713d|note|42", "text": "'were' 弱读为 /wər/。"}]